<view class="page">
  <view class="profile-head"><image src="/assets/png/app-logo-v2.png"/><view><view class="page-title">冰箱有数</view><view class="page-subtitle">家里有什么、今天吃什么，心里都有数</view></view></view>
  <view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card loading-card">正在汇总数据…</view><view wx:elif="{{error}}" class="error-card">{{error}}</view>
  <block wx:else>
    <view class="stats card"><view><text>{{kindCount}}</text><text class="stat-label">食材种类</text></view><view><text>{{masteredCount}}</text><text class="stat-label">已掌握食谱</text></view><view><text>{{monthlyCookCount}}</text><text class="stat-label">本月做菜</text></view></view>
    <view class="section"><view class="section-title">偏好设置</view><view class="settings card">
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{reminderOptions}}" value="{{reminderIndex}}" bindchange="onReminderChange"><view class="setting-row"><view><text>新鲜度提醒范围</text><text class="setting-label">首页优先食材的提示范围</text></view><view class="value">未来 {{reminderOptions[reminderIndex]}} 天 ›</view></view></picker>
      <view class="divider"></view>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{storageOptions}}" range-key="name" value="{{storageIndex}}" bindchange="onStorageChange"><view class="setting-row"><view><text>默认保存方式</text><text class="setting-label">购入页的默认选项</text></view><view class="value">{{storageOptions[storageIndex].name}} ›</view></view></picker>
    </view></view>
    <view class="section"><view class="section-title">数据与工具</view><view class="settings card"><view class="setting-row" bindtap="openCloudSync"><view><text>家庭与云同步</text><text class="setting-label">2.0 预览：多成员、离线队列与显式迁移</text></view><view class="value">查看 ›</view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="openShopping"><view><text>购物清单</text><text class="setting-label">缺料与待购食材</text></view><view class="value">›</view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="exportData"><view><text>导出 JSON</text><text class="setting-label">复制全部本地数据，共 {{recordCount}} 条做菜记录</text></view><view class="value">复制 ›</view></view><view class="divider"></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="importData"><view><text>导入 JSON</text><text class="setting-label">从剪贴板校验并导入，自动保留当前数据备份</text></view><view class="value">导入 ›</view></view><block wx:if="{{hasImportBackup}}"><view class="divider"></view><view class="setting-row" bindtap="restoreImportBackup"><view><text>恢复导入前数据</text><text class="setting-label">撤回上一次导入；当前数据也会保留为回退备份</text></view><view class="value">恢复 ›</view></view></block><view class="divider"></view><view class="setting-row danger-row" bindtap="resetData"><view><text>清空全部数据</text><text class="setting-label">删除本机库存、进度、记录、清单与导入备份</text></view><view class="value">清空 ›</view></view></view></view>
    <view class="privacy-card card"><text class="privacy-title">默认只在当前设备</text><text>游客模式不会登录或上传。未来只有在你主动开启家庭云同步并确认迁移后，数据才会写入所选家庭空间。</text></view>
    <view class="about"><image src="/assets/png/app-logo-v2.png"/><text>冰箱有数 2.0 Alpha · 本地优先</text><text>冰箱有数，吃饭不愁。</text><text>新鲜度仅为个人库存管理建议，不构成食品安全判断。</text></view>
  </block>
</view>
